{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用场景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"demand-forecasting","title":"需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/demand-forecasting","wordCount":1288,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"financial-forecasting","title":"金融时序预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/financial-forecasting","wordCount":1287,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"anomaly-detection","title":"时序异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/anomaly-detection","wordCount":1516,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 应用场景\n\n时间序列预测的商业价值在具体领域中兑现。本章选取三个代表性方向：需求预测（电商/供应链/能源）、金融时序预测（收益率/波动率/风险因子）、时序异常检测（运维/制造/安全）。\n\n每个应用场景都有其独特的数据特征、评估标准和工程约束。需求预测追求供需匹配的库存成本最优；金融预测面对极低信噪比和结构性断裂；异常检测需要在误报与漏报之间找到业务可接受的平衡点。\n"}